     1,
     "<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"font:inherit\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:blue;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Data Mining Survey – Last Call</span></b><span style=\"COLOR:blue\"></span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">We want you to take the 4<sup>th</sup> Annual Data Miner Survey.<span>  </span>If you haven’t taken it yet, please click on the survey link and take it now.</span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Survey Link: </span><b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"><a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-2010-Intro2.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-2010-Intro2.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KPsOxAnlZwGMuDc81okmd\"><span>www.RexerAnalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-2010-Intro2.html</span></a></span></b><span style=\"COLOR:#333333\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Access Code:  </span><b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">RY63U</span></b><span style=\"COLOR:#333333\"><br><br></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">The survey will take approximately 20 minutes to complete.  </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"COLOR:#333333\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"> </font></span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Please also forward this email to other data miners in your network.<span>  </span>Your help in spreading the word is essential for getting a large and diverse sample of data miners.<span>  </span>Anyone who has had this email forwarded to them can use the access code in the forwarded email.</span><span style=\"COLOR:#333333\"><br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Thank you to all the data miners who have already completed the survey and have told others about it.<span>  </span>You’ve helped us get over 500 responses so far.<span>  </span>We also wish to thank all the people in the data mining community who provided suggestions and helped shape this year’s research.<span>  </span>If you have ideas for new survey questions or ways to improve next year’s Data Miner Survey, please send your ideas to us.<span>  </span>This research is conducted each year by <a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28JOHa5zYdt6eY_51ggeY3\"><span>Rexer Analytics</span></a>, and the results are made available to everyone via FREE Summary Reports.</span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">We look forward to sharing the results with you, and to continuing to build on this research foundation each year.<span>  </span>We will announce the survey results this Fall at the <a href=\"http://www.predictiveanalyticsworld.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.predictiveanalyticsworld.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ituHXddLON0BLW1aar07_\"><span>Predictive Analytics World Conference</span></a>.<span>  </span>At that time we will also post a bulleted summary of the results on <a href=\"http://www.kdnuggets.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.kdnuggets.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EHltZEksQTcH4OhxE14fr\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span>KDnuggets</span></font></a> and distribute the full FREE Summary Report via email to everyone who requests it – there is a check box at the end of the survey to request the summary report.<span>  </span></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Information about Rexer Analytics is available at <a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28JOHa5zYdt6eY_51ggeY3\"><span>www.RexerAnalytics.com</span></a>.<span>  </span>Questions about this research program and the summary reports can be directed to <a href=\"http://us.mc11.mail.yahoo.com/mc/compose?to=Dat...@RexerAnalytics.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://us.mc11.mail.yahoo.com/mc/compose?to%...@RexerAnalytics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YSwx_zGQAYRu4GVmllSVF\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span>DataMin...@RexerAnalytics.com</span></font></a>.<span>  </span>The free 48 page Summary Report for the 3<sup>rd</sup> Annual Data Miner Survey is available now.<span>  </span>If you want to receive a copy, just email us.</span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">Thank you for your time.<span>  </span></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\">-- Karl </span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:#333333;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;sans-serif&#39;\"> </span> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:blue\">====================== </span></i><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"></span></i></font>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><b><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:blue\">Karl Rexer, PhD </span></i></b><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"></span></i></font>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:blue\">President, Rexer Analytics </span></i><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"></span></i></font>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"><a title=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/\" href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28JOHa5zYdt6eY_51ggeY3\"><span><font face=\"Times New Roman\">www.RexerAnalytics.com</font></span></a><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"COLOR:blue\"> </span></font></span></i> \r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:blue\"><span style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM:#366388 2px dotted\"><a href=\"tel:(617)%20233-8185\" value=\"+16172338185\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">617-233-8185</a></span></span></i><i><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"> </span></i><span></span></font>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"COLOR:#333333\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"> </font></span> </p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></td></tr></table>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;rattle-users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle-users...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n\r\nFor more options, visit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rattle-users?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rattle-users?hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479413851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tgH4oeeIke9CBRIDkTi0F\">http://groups.google.com/group/rattle-users?hl=en</a>.<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n"
